---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | López Márquez Abogados" description="Information about personal data processing and enquiries submitted through this website." noindex={true}>
<PageHero eyebrow="Legal information" title="Privacy Policy" description="How data submitted through this website is handled and how to exercise your rights." />
<section class="section"><div class="container prose">
  <h2>1. Enquiries and contact</h2>
  <p>The public contact channel is identified as <strong>{site.name}</strong>. For privacy-related communications, email <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>2. Data processed</h2>
  <p>Depending on your enquiry, data may include your name, email address, phone number if provided, legal area, relevant date, message, source page and technical data required to protect the service. Do not send ID documents, passport details, bank information or medical information in the first contact.</p>
  <h2>3. Purposes and legal bases</h2>
  <p>Data is used to receive and answer enquiries, understand the issue and any urgency, assess whether it fits the services offered, manage a possible professional relationship and protect the form. The legal basis depends on the processing concerned and may include consent provided when submitting the form and pre-contractual steps requested by the data subject.</p>
  <h2>4. Recipients</h2>
  <p>Access is limited to those who need to handle the enquiry and to providers supplying hosting, web infrastructure, storage, security and communications delivery. Those providers must process data according to the functions and safeguards applicable to each service.</p>
  <h2>5. International transfers</h2>
  <p>Technology providers may operate in different countries. Where processing involves an international transfer, the mechanisms and safeguards required by applicable data-protection law must apply to that transfer.</p>
  <h2>6. Retention</h2>
  <p>Data is retained for as long as needed to handle the enquiry and any requested follow-up. It is then deleted or removed from ordinary use when no longer necessary, without prejudice to periods required for legal obligations or potential claims.</p>
  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may request access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection and portability where applicable, and withdraw consent where processing is based on it. Email <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> and state which right you wish to exercise.</p>
  <p>You may also complain to the <a href="https://www.aepd.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spanish Data Protection Agency</a>.</p>
  <h2>8. Security and sensitive data</h2>
  <p>The website applies technical and organisational measures proportionate to handling enquiries. The initial form does not require documents or special categories of data. If documents need to be reviewed, an appropriate channel will be indicated.</p>
</div></section>
</Layout>
